---
// 首頁「我想要…」任務入口：六張小卡，各連到既有頁面；左側導覽不變。觸控目標至少 44px。
// 每張卡上方一張示意圖：工具實機截圖局部或影片縮圖（public/home-tasks/），純裝飾、alt 留空。
import { url } from '../lib/url';
import { videosOf } from '../lib/videos';

type Task = { zh: string; desc: string; to: string; img: string; more?: { label: string; to: string }[] };
const manual = '/tools/pcb-si/manual/';
const tasks: Task[] = [
  { zh: '申請試用與安裝', desc: '填試用申請，收到安裝包後核對、安裝與啟用授權。', to: '/trial/', img: 'trial', more: [{ label: '安裝步驟', to: '/tools/pcb-si/quick-start/' }] },
  { zh: '第一次跑通', desc: '用內附範例板，從載板一路做到 HTML 報告。', to: manual, img: 'first-run' },
  {
    zh: '查某個步驟',
    desc: '直接跳到操作說明的章節：',
    to: manual,
    img: 'steps',
    more: [
      { label: '裁切', to: `${manual}#3-preview-and-cut--預覽與裁切` },
      { label: 'Port', to: `${manual}#4-ports-and-frequency--port-與頻率` },
      { label: '分段', to: `${manual}#6-segment-the-channel--分段` },
      { label: '串接', to: `${manual}#8-cascade--電路串接` },
      { label: 'TDR', to: `${manual}#11-tdr--tdr-阻抗定位` },
      { label: '報告', to: `${manual}#12-html-report--一鍵-html-報告` },
    ],
  },
  { zh: '看操作影片', desc: `工具操作教學 ${videosOf('pcb-si', 'tool-guide').length} 支與 AI Agent 流程示範，點縮圖才播放。`, to: '/tools/pcb-si/videos/', img: 'videos' },
  { zh: '遇到問題', desc: '先查常見問題，可重現的錯誤再回報。', to: '/tools/pcb-si/faq/', img: 'problems', more: [{ label: 'Bug 回報', to: '/tools/pcb-si/bugs/' }] },
  { zh: '看更新了什麼', desc: '各版本的新功能與修正。', to: '/tools/pcb-si/changelog/', img: 'changelog' },
];
---
<ul class="tasks not-content" aria-label="我想要…">
  {tasks.map((t) => (
    <li class="task">
      <a class="task-main" href={url(t.to)}>
        <span class="task-img"><img src={url(`/home-tasks/${t.img}.webp`)} width="640" height="360" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
        <span class="task-title">{t.zh}</span>
        <span class="task-desc">{t.desc}</span>
      </a>
      {t.more && (
        <span class="task-more">
          {t.more.map((m) => <a href={url(m.to)}>{m.label}</a>)}
        </span>
      )}
    </li>
  ))}
</ul>

<style>
  .tasks {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .task {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: var(--site-radius);
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
  }
  .task:hover { border-color: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .task-img {
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    margin: -0.75rem -1rem 0.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: var(--site-radius) var(--site-radius) 0 0;
    background: #111;
  }
  .task-img img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top left; }
  .task-main:hover .task-img img { filter: brightness(0.92); }
  .task-main {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .task-title {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
  .task-main:hover .task-title { color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  .task-desc { color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .task-more { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 0.75rem; padding: 0 1rem 0.25rem; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .task-more a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; }
  .task-main:focus-visible { outline-offset: -2px; border-radius: var(--site-radius); }
  @media (max-width: 64rem) { .tasks { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 30rem) { .tasks { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>
